It's good to hear from you again, thinkit.  
But if a computer ever becomes sentient, I hope it would come up with its own 
language, if it needed one.  I don't think Lojban would be such a great 
language for it, especially as its native language.  It has lots of good features, 
and it's worth learning, but there's almost nothing good about the vocabulary. 
 

